<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- @dsCard group="Brand" name="Deep Ocean — Job Match" subtitle="Paste JD → CV fit score + keyword gap analysis" viewport="1280x900" -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Job Match — RemoteJobs44</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="colors_and_type.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="components.css">
<style>
  html,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden;}body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
  .topbar{ position: relative;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;height:60px;padding:0 24px;background:var(--bg-card);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-1);z-index:100;}
  .topbar .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-decoration:none;flex-shrink:0;}
  .topbar .brand b{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:16px;color:var(--fg-1);letter-spacing:-0.02em;}
  .topbar .brand b span{color:var(--brand-600);}
  .topbar-search { /* centered */ position: absolute; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); top: 18px; width: clamp(240px, 30vw, 360px); flex: none; max-width: none; }
  .topbar-search .search-box{height:36px;background:var(--bg-section);border-color:var(--border-2);}
  .topbar-search .search-box input{font-size:13.5px;}
  .topbar-right{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
  .tb-ico{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--border-2);background:var(--bg-section);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;color:var(--fg-3);position:relative;}
  .tb-badge{position:absolute;top:-4px;right:-4px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand-600);color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center;}
  .tb-avatar{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:2px solid var(--brand-300);}
  .tb-name{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--fg-1);}
  .shell{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px 1fr;overflow:hidden;}
  .sidebar{overflow-y:auto;background:var(--bg-card);border-right:1px solid var(--border-1);padding:20px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;}
  .nav-label{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-4);padding:14px 10px 6px;}
  .nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--fg-2);text-decoration:none;transition:all var(--dur-fast);}
  .nav-item svg{width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0;}
  .nav-item:hover{background:var(--bg-section);color:var(--fg-1);}
  .nav-item.active{background:var(--brand-50);color:var(--brand-700);font-weight:700;}
  [data-theme="dark"] .nav-item.active{background:rgba(59,130,246,0.14);color:var(--brand-400);}
  .nav-item .nbadge{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:var(--brand-600);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:999px;}
  .sidebar-footer{margin-top:auto;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-3);}
  .main{overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-app);display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
  .jm-topbar{flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:14px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-1);background:var(--bg-card);}
  .jm-topbar h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:18px;color:var(--fg-1);margin:0;letter-spacing:-0.02em;}
  .jm-body{flex:1;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0;}
  .jm-left{overflow-y:auto;padding:22px 24px;border-right:1px solid var(--border-1);}
  .jm-left::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px;}.jm-left::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--border-2);border-radius:4px;}
  .jm-right{overflow-y:auto;padding:22px 24px;background:var(--bg-section);}
  .jm-right::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px;}.jm-right::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--border-2);border-radius:4px;}
  .inp-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-4);margin-bottom:8px;display:block;}
  .jd-box{width:100%;background:var(--bg-section);border:1.5px solid var(--border-2);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--fg-1);outline:none;resize:none;height:280px;transition:border-color var(--dur-fast);}
  .jd-box:focus{border-color:var(--brand-500);}
  .cv-sel{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:14px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--bg-card);border:1.5px solid var(--border-1);border-radius:11px;}
  .cv-sel .cs-ic{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--brand-50);color:var(--brand-600);display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;}
  [data-theme="dark"] .cv-sel .cs-ic{background:rgba(59,130,246,0.1);}
  .cv-sel .cs-ic svg{width:16px;height:16px;}
  .cv-sel .cs-t{flex:1;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--fg-1);}
  .cv-sel .cs-s{font-size:12px;color:var(--fg-3);}
  .score-hero{text-align:center;padding:20px 0 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-3);margin-bottom:18px;}
  .score-ring-big{position:relative;width:110px;height:110px;margin:0 auto 10px;}
  .score-ring-big svg{transform:rotate(-90deg);}
  .score-ring-big .sn{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
  .score-ring-big .sn .big{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:30px;color:var(--fg-1);line-height:1;}
  .score-ring-big .sn .pct{font-size:13px;color:var(--fg-3);}
  .score-label{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--fg-1);}
  .score-sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--fg-3);}
  .jm-sec{margin-bottom:20px;}
  .jm-sec h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:var(--fg-1);margin:0 0 12px;}
  .kw-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;}
  .kw{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid;}
  .kw.match{background:rgba(34,197,94,0.09);color:var(--success);border-color:rgba(34,197,94,0.3);}
  .kw.gap{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.08);color:#ef4444;border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.25);}
  .kw.partial{background:rgba(249,115,22,0.09);color:var(--accent);border-color:rgba(249,115,22,0.3);}
  .tip-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-3);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--fg-2);line-height:1.5;}
  .tip-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .tip-ic{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;}
  .tip-ic svg{width:13px;height:13px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <a class="brand" href="Member Dashboard Desktop.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" style="width:30px;height:30px"><defs><linearGradient id="lg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="32" y2="32" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2563eb"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1e3a5f"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="32" height="32" rx="8" fill="url(#lg)"/><path d="M8 20 Q12 10 16 16 Q20 22 23 12" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="23" cy="12" r="2.5" fill="#f97316"/></svg><b>RemoteJobs<span>44</span></b></a>
  <div class="topbar-search"><div class="search-box"><svg class="s-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg><input type="text" placeholder="Search remote jobs…"></div></div>
  <div class="topbar-right">
    <button class="theme-toggle tb-ico" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" aria-pressed="false" style="border:none"><svg class="i-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg><svg class="i-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M6.34 17.66l-1.41 1.41M19.07 4.93l-1.41 1.41"/></svg></button>
    <div class="tb-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.4 0"/></svg><span class="tb-badge">3</span></div>
    <span class="tb-name">Ada Obi</span><img class="tb-avatar" src="assets/people-4-portrait.jpg" alt="Ada Obi">
  </div>
</header>
<div class="shell">
  <nav class="sidebar">
    <div class="nav-label">Menu</div>
    <a class="nav-item" href="Member Dashboard Desktop.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/></svg>Dashboard</a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="Browse Jobs.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg>Browse Jobs<span class="nbadge">12</span></a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="Saved Jobs.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 21l-7-5-7 5V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>Saved Jobs</a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="Applications.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>Applications<span class="nbadge">4</span></a>
    <div class="nav-label">Tools</div>
    <a class="nav-item" href="CV Builder.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/><path d="M16 13H8M16 17H8M10 9H8"/></svg>CV Builder</a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="Cover Letter.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>Cover Letters</a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="AI Interview.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"/><rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2"/></svg>AI Interview</a>
    <a class="nav-item active" href="Job Match.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="4"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="10"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="16"/></svg>Job Match</a>
    <div class="nav-label">Account</div>
    <a class="nav-item" href="Profile.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>Profile</a>
    <a class="nav-item" href="Alerts.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.4 0"/></svg>Alerts<span class="nbadge">3</span></a>
    <div class="sidebar-footer"><a class="nav-item" href="B Login.html"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4"/><polyline points="16 17 21 12 16 7"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="9" y2="12"/></svg>Sign out</a></div>
  </nav>
  <main class="main">
    <div class="jm-topbar" data-screen-label="Job Match · Topbar">
      <h1>Job Match</h1>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Analyse new JD</a>
    </div>
    <div class="jm-body" data-screen-label="Job Match · Body">
      <div class="jm-left">
        <span class="inp-label">Paste job description</span>
        <textarea class="jd-box">Senior Frontend Engineer — Vercel (Remote, Worldwide)

We're looking for a senior frontend engineer to own our checkout and dashboard experiences. You will:
• Build high-performance interfaces in React, Next.js and TypeScript
• Lead our component design system and accessibility standards
• Collaborate with design and product in Figma
• Write thorough tests (Jest, Playwright) and own CI/CD quality gates

Requirements: 5+ years frontend, deep React & TypeScript knowledge, strong CS fundamentals, experience with GraphQL or REST, excellent written communication for async-first teams.</textarea>
        <div class="cv-sel">
          <div class="cs-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/></svg></div>
          <div><div class="cs-t">Ada Obi — Senior Frontend Engineer.pdf</div><div class="cs-s">Active CV · Updated 2d ago</div></div>
          <a href="CV Builder.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Change</a>
        </div>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center">Analyse fit →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="jm-right">
        <div class="score-hero">
          <div class="score-ring-big">
            <svg width="110" height="110" viewBox="0 0 110 110"><circle cx="55" cy="55" r="44" fill="none" stroke="var(--border-2)" stroke-width="10"/><circle cx="55" cy="55" r="44" fill="none" stroke="url(#jmGrad)" stroke-width="10" stroke-dasharray="276.5" stroke-dashoffset="41.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><defs><linearGradient id="jmGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2563eb"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#22c55e"/></linearGradient></defs></svg>
            <div class="sn"><div class="big">85</div><div class="pct">/ 100</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="score-label">Strong match</div>
          <div class="score-sub">Your CV covers 17 of 20 required signals</div>
        </div>
        <div class="jm-sec"><h3>Matched keywords <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--success)">(12 matched)</span></h3><div class="kw-grid"><span class="kw match">React</span><span class="kw match">TypeScript</span><span class="kw match">Next.js</span><span class="kw match">GraphQL</span><span class="kw match">Figma</span><span class="kw match">Component library</span><span class="kw match">Remote-first</span><span class="kw match">Async communication</span><span class="kw match">Performance</span><span class="kw match">Accessibility</span><span class="kw match">CI/CD</span><span class="kw match">REST API</span></div></div>
        <div class="jm-sec"><h3>Gaps to address <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#ef4444">(3 missing)</span></h3><div class="kw-grid"><span class="kw gap">Playwright</span><span class="kw gap">Jest (explicit)</span><span class="kw gap">Checkout UX</span></div></div>
        <div class="jm-sec"><h3>Partial matches <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--accent)">(2 partial)</span></h3><div class="kw-grid"><span class="kw partial">Design systems (deepen)</span><span class="kw partial">CS fundamentals (add examples)</span></div></div>
        <div class="jm-sec"><h3>How to win this one</h3>
          <div class="tip-row"><div class="tip-ic" style="background:rgba(37,99,235,0.1);color:var(--brand-600)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/></svg></div>Add a CV bullet mentioning Jest and Playwright explicitly — you likely have the experience, it's just not surfaced.</div>
          <div class="tip-row"><div class="tip-ic" style="background:rgba(249,115,22,0.1);color:var(--accent)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg></div>Vercel cares deeply about DX — mention open-source contributions or any Next.js community work in your cover letter.</div>
          <div class="tip-row"><div class="tip-ic" style="background:rgba(34,197,94,0.1);color:var(--success)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>Your remote-first track record (4 years) is a strong differentiator — lead with it in your intro paragraph.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a href="CV Builder.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Tailor CV for this role</a><a href="Cover Letter.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Write cover letter</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
<script src="shared.js"></script>
<script>initTheme('.theme-toggle','rj44-theme-dash');</script>
</body>
</html>
